{"kind":"rss","id":"youku:series:bcaa87c7834c46f99e7b","title":"嫁金钗 · 剧集更新","link":"https://v.youku.com/v_nextstage/id_bcaa87c7834c46f99e7b.html","description":"阿丑原是街上倒夜香的低贱少女，人人皆可践踏欺凌，只因一张酷似侯府千金魏娆的面容，意外成为国公府世子陆濯的冲喜新娘。阿丑野心勃勃，一心借机上位，然而濒死的新婚丈夫忽然苏醒，鸠占鹊巢引来连绵灾祸。魏娆恨她鸠占鹊巢，急欲除之后快；陆濯以她为蛇蝎妇人，百般提防谋算。国公府明面一团和气，实则陷阱重重、步步杀机。阿丑于暗流中奋力周旋各方、筹谋前路，挣脱命运桎梏，更查出了自己身世的秘密，与至亲最终团圆，从底层夜香妇一路逆袭上位，过出光芒万丈的锦绣人生。","language":"zh-cn","image":"http://m.ykimg.com/058400006AFD22D446663C138E573F46","items":[{"id":"youku:episode:bcaa87c7834c46f99e7b:XNjU2ODM3MDI4MA==","title":"嫁金钗 第30集","link":"https://v.youku.com/v_show/id_XNjU2ODM3MDI4MA==.html","description":"","image":"https://m.ykimg.com/054F01016ADDBDBA2CD719220A0599DE"},{"id":"youku:episode:bcaa87c7834c46f99e7b:XNjU2ODM3MDI2NA==","title":"嫁金钗 第29集","link":"https://v.youku.com/v_show/id_XNjU2ODM3MDI2NA==.html","description":"","image":"https://m.ykimg.com/054F01016ADDBF5C334D99248833D135"},{"id":"youku:episode:bcaa87c7834c46f99e7b:XNjU3Nzg2NjcyMA==","title":"嫁金钗 第28集","link":"https://v.youku.com/v_show/id_XNjU3Nzg2NjcyMA==.html","description":"","image":"https://m.ykimg.com/054F01016AD62F2F27CFC616CF20D782"},{"id":"youku:episode:bcaa87c7834c46f99e7b:XNjU2ODM3MzE4NA==","title":"嫁金钗 第27集","link":"https://v.youku.com/v_show/id_XNjU2ODM3MzE4NA==.html","description":"","image":"https://m.ykimg.com/054F01016AD6294350A9E5251DBC038A"},{"id":"youku:episode:bcaa87c7834c46f99e7b:XNjU3Nzg2OTczNg==","title":"嫁金钗 第26集","link":"https://v.youku.com/v_show/id_XNjU3Nzg2OTczNg==.html","description":"","image":"https://m.ykimg.com/054F01016ACF975F0E422B1622B64E34"},{"id":"youku:episode:bcaa87c7834c46f99e7b:XNjU2ODM3MDIzNg==","title":"嫁金钗 第25集","link":"https://v.youku.com/v_show/id_XNjU2ODM3MDIzNg==.html","description":"","image":"https://m.ykimg.com/054F01016ADA7E9D32FB6114ED0BA653"},{"id":"youku:episode:bcaa87c7834c46f99e7b:XNjU2ODM3NjEwMA==","title":"嫁金钗 第24集","link":"https://v.youku.com/v_show/id_XNjU2ODM3NjEwMA==.html","description":"","image":"https://m.ykimg.com/